2026-07-27T14:49:06.4391557Z [36;1m# / -std=gnu++20 for C++); a plain "CC = ccache gcc" override would drop[0m
2026-07-27T14:49:06.4392049Z [36;1m# them and silently downgrade the standard across the version matrix.[0m
2026-07-27T14:49:06.4392548Z [36;1m# Inference uses an empty user Makevars so we always read the pristine[0m
2026-07-27T14:49:06.4392988Z [36;1m# Makeconf defaults, never a value we just wrote.[0m
